#
# A repair job line's cost in minor units, in Sutra (ratchet_rules.h RR5):
# the parts (qty units at price each) plus the labour (minutes at rate a
# minute), exact. qty fits 9(4), price 9(9), minutes 9(5) and rate 9(7);
# a value past its picture, or a negative, is a size error, refused.
# cost.tb answers each field to nine digits: past these pictures held.
record repair-line
  qty: 9(4)
  price: 9(9)
  minutes: 9(5)
  rate: 9(7)
  cost: 9(14)
procedure
  compute cost = qty * price + minutes * rate
  answer cost
